{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ScanOnce 是一款注重私隱的 PDF 掃描工具，適合需要將紙本文件數碼化的用戶。掃描、文字辨識與檔案整理都在 iPhone 上完成，毋須註冊帳號或訂閱服務。App 現正限時免費，原價 US $4.99。</p>\n\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<p>開啟相機即可自動偵測頁面邊緣、校正透視並一次掃描多頁文件；文字辨識在 iPhone 上完成，可搜尋文件內的關鍵字。輸出方面，可將掃描結果分享為 PDF、以 JPEG 匯出單頁或直接列印，亦支援旋轉、裁剪、彩色、灰階與高對比黑白模式，並可重新排列頁面、重新命名與整理到資料夾。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ScanOnce: PDF Scanner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T10:00:43.566536+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}